FiLM-OSG reproducibility code

This repository contains reproducibility code for the FiLM-OSG manuscript.

DUE attribution
---------------

Portions of the local `film_osg` package are adapted from DUE:

    AI4Equations/DUE
    https://github.com/AI4Equations/due
    License: LGPL-2.1

DUE is prior work from our group. The local copies are included to make the
FiLM-OSG reproducibility scripts runnable without requiring the external `due`
package on the primary execution path, while preserving compatibility with
historical DUE-style APIs and model files.

Local modules adapted from DUE include:

    film_osg/datasets/pde.py
    film_osg/models/pde.py
    film_osg/models/pde_osg.py
    film_osg/networks/nn.py
    film_osg/networks/fno.py
    film_osg/utils.py

The extra-backbone module:

    film_osg/networks/osg_extra_backbones.py

is local FiLM-OSG experiment code, but it intentionally follows the DUE-style
network interface so those variants can be trained and evaluated through the
same OSG-compatible wrappers.

FNO reference
-------------

The FNO implementation also follows the public neuraloperator Fourier neural
operator reference:

    https://github.com/neuraloperator/neuraloperator/blob/master/fourier_2d_time.py

Scope of local changes
----------------------

These attributions document code provenance only. The reproducibility cleanup
does not change the manuscript protocol, model logic, hyperparameters, seed
settings, metric formulas, or reported experimental conclusions.
